  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Manching</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "At modern Manching are the remains of a massive proto-urban Celtic settlement (oppidum) that reached its maximum size of ca. 380 ha during the late La T\u00e8ne period (late second century BC). It is possibly to be identified with Vallatum, a civic entity mentioned in ancient sources.",
